availability status: Preorder
estimated availability: May 1, 2026
board type: All Mountain
flex: 6/10 (1=soft, 10=stiff)
rider level: Advanced
shape: Twin (symmetrical with identical tip and tail, equal performance riding forward or switch)
camber type: Resort V1 + Flat Kick Tech (combines traditional camber, zero camber, and reverse camber with Flat Kick Tech for pop and response of camber with predictability and effortless turn initiation)
sidecut type: Blended Radial (single-radius arc through midsection, custom blend zone at contact points tailored to specific riding styles)
width options: Standard, Wide
mounting system: 2x4 Inserts (tighter hole pattern for more precise stance adjustments)
available lengths: 152cm, 154cm, 156cm, 158cm, 160cm, 155cm Wide, 157cm Wide, 159cm Wide, 161cm Wide
topsheet: Matte Topsheet - Digital Print and Metallic Underlay (PAM16000 Printing technology with 16,000 inkjet nozzles, solventless water-based UV ink, plus hand screen printed portion)
laminate: Hybrid SuperCarbon HolySheet Tri/Tri (high tensile strength, low elasticity fiberglass weaves with greater roving count, tri-axial layers above and below core, carbon additives interwoven into fiberglass laminate for enhanced durability, stability, ride quality, reduced weight)
resin: Magic Bean Resin (plant-based, high bio-content, zero waste, no greenhouse emissions, low production temperatures, high yield/strength/durability, enhanced rigidity allows thinner wood core)
core: 3D Thermopolymer Starship Core (3D cut mega-premium reforestation-certified Poplar, graded for weight and grain consistency, strength-to-weight ratio similar to Paulownia, bonded post-consumer recycled Thermopolymer channels)
sidewalls: Fortress Aramid Bound Sidewall (reinforced with Kevlar "S" wrap extending from top of sidewall to beneath core, lightweight design connecting sidewall and core)
base: Hyperdrive ADV XT Base (premium sintered polyethylene, highest levels of anti-friction due to high molecular mass, extra thick for enhanced durability)
base structure: Moonshot Omni-Tune (high-performance race-base structure, channels water away at 45-degree angle)
base graphics: Laser-guided die-cutting technology for razor-sharp edges and vibrant colors
